      <activity id="6e23bbcd-e551-573c-b8e3-ba8c7d7d6b64" activityNameId="2afbc045-56d5-5ce6-9fc0-268515f86867" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, at cogen, biogas agricultural mix, allocation exergy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, at cogen, biogas agricultural mix, allocation exergy
This process gives the mix of electricity production from biogas from agricultural plants in Switzerland in the year 2006;
UUID: 720ab013-4c7d-3539-bc08-50d2c3542776
This process connects the different productions for electricity from agricultural biogas plants.
Location: For this process 20 plants in Switzerland producing about 50% of electricity from biogas have been evaluated.
Technology: Mix of biogas engines and ignition gas engine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 25 GWh electricity, 12 mio. m3 Biogas 
Sampling: The data are the average of 20 plants in Switzerland 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_720ab013-4c7d-3539-bc08-50d2c3542776.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
